  "miitDescription": " Myanmar Institute of Information Technology (MIIT) was established in 2015 \nas a National Centre of Excellence under the Ministry of Science & Technology \nin Myanmar. It resulted from a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between \nthe governments of Myanmar and India, signed in May 2012, designed to model \nthe institute after India’s International Institute of Information Technology, \nBangalore (IIIT-B).MIIT offers two undergraduate degree programmes: \nB.E. (Honours) in Computer Science & Engineering (CSE) \nB.E. (Honours) in Electronics & Communication Engineering (ECE) . \nMIIT is  situated in Chanmyathazi Township, Mandalay, at the corner of \n73rd Street and Ngu Shwe Wah Street",
